:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:27:\"Events Calendar Pro 7.5.0.1\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:92:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/release-notes/events-calendar-pro/events-calendar-pro-7-5-0-1/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 15 May 2025 17:25:55 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:19:\"Events Calendar Pro\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"release notes\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:40:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/?p=2548676\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:598:\"<p>Summary Maintenance Release This version of Events Calendar Pro ensures that saving events with checkbox-type additional fields does not produce a fatal error. As always, we recommend testing updates on a staging site first, but it should all be smooth sailing. ✅ Fixes Bugs squashed in this release: 🗣 Translations Updated language files and strings:</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/release-notes/events-calendar-pro/events-calendar-pro-7-5-0-1/\">Events Calendar Pro 7.5.0.1</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com\">The Events Calendar</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Emily Negroni\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2806:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.3%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-summary\">Summary</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"release-label has-normal-font-size\">Maintenance Release</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p class=\"release-summary__overview has-medium-font-size\">This version of Events Calendar Pro ensures that saving events with checkbox-type additional fields does not produce a fatal error.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As always, we recommend <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/knowledgebase/k/creating-and-using-a-wordpress-staging-site/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">testing updates</a> on a staging site first, but it should all be smooth sailing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-fixes\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.1.0/72x72/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Fixes</h4>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Bugs squashed in this release:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Ensures that saving events with checkbox-type additional fields does not produce a fatal error.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.3%\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-translations\"><img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.1.0/72x72/1f5e3.png\" alt=\"🗣\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> Translations</h4>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Updated language files and strings:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>0 new strings added</li>\n\n\n\n<li>0 updated</li>\n\n\n\n<li>0 fuzzied</li>\n\n\n\n<li>0 obsoleted</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/release-notes/events-calendar-pro/events-calendar-pro-7-5-0-1/\">Events Calendar Pro 7.5.0.1</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com\">The Events Calendar</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:1;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:63:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:80:\"QR Codes are Here! Connect Promotional Material to Your Event Calendar with Ease\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:115:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/qr-codes-are-here-connect-promotional-material-to-your-event-calendar-with-ease/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Thu, 15 May 2025 16:37:01 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:3:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"Blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:10:\"What\'s New\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:4:\"blog\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:40:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/?p=2547928\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:684:\"<p>Today 72% of event planners consider QR codes a must-have in their event toolkit. That&#8217;s why, with the latest update to The Events Calendar, we’ve rolled out built-in QR code generation– a feature designed to bridge the gap between your digital calendar and real-world experiences. Whether you manage conferences, concerts, or community events, this new...</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/qr-codes-are-here-connect-promotional-material-to-your-event-calendar-with-ease/\">QR Codes are Here! Connect Promotional Material to Your Event Calendar with Ease</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com\">The Events Calendar</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Sarah Zuercher\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:27449:\"\n<p>Today <a href=\"https://www.eventmanagerblog.com/\">72% of event planners consider QR codes a must-have</a> in their event toolkit. That&#8217;s why, with the latest update to <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/products/wordpress-events-calendar/\">The Events Calendar</a>, we’ve rolled out built-in QR code generation– a feature designed to bridge the gap between your digital calendar and real-world experiences. Whether you manage conferences, concerts, or community events, this new feature makes it easy to connect your audience to the right information at the right time.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe title=\"New Feature! QR Code Generation for The Events Calendar\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wkaKv-pgcy0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Is This Made for You? (Spoiler: Yes!)</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>This feature automatically generates QR codes for every event you publish. These codes can be downloaded and used across digital and physical marketing materials (think posters, flyers, jumbotrons, and more.) No long URLs or confusion, just instant access.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For users of Events Calendar Pro, this feature includes <strong>dynamic series QR codes that automatically redirect attendees to the next upcoming event in a recurring series</strong>. So instead of updating and reprinting materials every month, you can use one evergreen code all season long.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>This feature is built for <em>you</em>. It’s especially useful if you want to:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Bridge physical and digital event promotion</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Provide instant access to event info, registration, and more</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Integrate QR code functionality seamlessly into your event creation workflow</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Limit manual entry errors and friction for attendees</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Reduce printing costs with evergreen marketing assets</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Share events quickly across a variety of platforms</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4 Smart Ways to Use QR Codes</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>QR codes can make your job easier and your event planning smoother. Whether planning a massive conference or a cozy community meetup, QR codes can do more than just point to an event page. Let’s explore creative and innovative ways to make the most of them.</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Promote Recurring Events Without Reprinting: </strong>Festival promoters or music series organizers can save serious time and printing costs by using dynamic series QR codes. Print one code on all materials and it can automatically direct fans to the next upcoming event.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Connect Print Materials to Online Ticketing: </strong>Theater directors can use QR codes on posters, flyers, and programs to link directly to show details. It makes it easy for patrons to go from interest to purchase in seconds.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Maximize Space on Flyers: </strong>University events managers dealing with limited poster space can use QR codes to pack in more information—event details, RSVP links, calendar add-ons—without cluttering up the design.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Turn Tables into Promo Tools: </strong>Restaurant owners can boost attendance for special events by adding QR codes to receipts, menus, or table tents. Diners can scan to see upcoming wine tastings, live music nights, or chef’s dinners.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Using the Event Calendar’s New QR Code Feature</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Based on customer feedback we know that many of our users depend on third party solutions for QR code generation–especially if they need dynamic QR codes for recurring events or event series. With this feature we have made QR code generation and management as simple as a few clicks within your WP Admin.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Generate and Download QR Codes</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>To get your QR code for an event, go to <strong>Events</strong> → <strong>Events</strong>. Hover over the event and select <strong>Generate QR Code.</strong> After a code has been generated for an event, this text will read “View QR Code.”</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1334\" height=\"786\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548404\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1.jpg 1334w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-300x177.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-665x392.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-140x82.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-768x453.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-600x354.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image1-1-500x295.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1334px) 100vw, 1334px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>A popup will appear in the middle of your screen. Download the PNG by selecting the size (if different than the default) and hitting the <strong>Download</strong> button.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1334\" height=\"820\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548410\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6.jpg 1334w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-300x184.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-665x409.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-138x85.jpg 138w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-768x472.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-600x369.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image6-500x307.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1334px) 100vw, 1334px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Event QR codes can also be found on each event’s editor screen.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1334\" height=\"734\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548411\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8.jpg 1334w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-300x165.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-665x366.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-140x77.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-768x423.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-600x330.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image8-500x275.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1334px) 100vw, 1334px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The two other areas Events Calendar Pro users will find QR codes available are under <strong>Events → Series</strong> and the editor screen for each series, same as the above example for single events. These QR codes are dynamic, which means the destination of the QR code changes over time. After each event in a series passes, the QR code will begin re-directing to the next event in the series.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">QR Code Block, Widget, and Shortcodes</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>There are some use cases in which you may want to use an event QR code on your website itself. You may be presenting or displaying your site on a large screen, for example. In those instances, you can use our new events QR code block, widget, and shortcodes.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Event QR Code Block</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>To add an Event QR Code to a page or post, add the Event QR Code Block.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1544\" height=\"834\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548412\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3.jpg 1544w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-300x162.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-665x359.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-140x76.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-768x415.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-1536x830.jpg 1536w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-600x324.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image3-500x270.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1544px) 100vw, 1544px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>You’ll be able to:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Give your QR code a title</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Set its display size</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Choose where the code redirects to when scanned</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1334\" height=\"798\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548413\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4.jpg 1334w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-300x179.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-665x398.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-140x85.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-768x459.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-600x359.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image4-500x299.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1334px) 100vw, 1334px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>There are a few redirection options to choose from:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Redirect to the current event:</strong> send users to the event that is currently happening. If there isn&#8217;t one, send them to the next future event.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redirect to the first upcoming event:</strong> send users to the next future event on the calendar.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redirect to a specific event ID:</strong> send users to a specific event you&#8217;ve selected.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Redirect to the next event in a series (Pro feature):</strong> send users to the next recurring event or event in a series.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<p>When you choose either of the last two options, a second dropdown will appear where you can choose the event you want to redirect to.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1518\" height=\"956\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548414\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9.jpg 1518w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-300x189.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-665x419.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-135x85.jpg 135w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-768x484.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-600x378.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image9-500x315.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1518px) 100vw, 1518px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Screenshot</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Once the Event QR Code Block is configured and saved, you’ll have a custom QR code on your website!</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1334\" height=\"736\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548415\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7.jpg 1334w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-300x166.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-665x367.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-140x77.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-768x424.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-600x331.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image7-500x276.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1334px) 100vw, 1334px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Event QR Code Widget</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Our widget is just like the block. You can access it by navigating to <strong>Appearance → Widgets </strong>and then adding the<strong> Events QR Code</strong> wherever it makes sense.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1999\" height=\"942\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2548416\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2.jpg 1999w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-300x141.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-665x313.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-140x66.jpg 140w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-768x362.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-1536x724.jpg 1536w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-600x283.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/05/image2-500x236.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1999px) 100vw, 1999px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Event QR Code Shortcodes</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>You also have the option of using a shortcode.</p>\n\n\n\n<pre class=\"wp-block-code\"><code>&#91;tec_event_qr mode=specific id=216 size=16]</code></pre>\n\n\n\n<p>The shortcode can be modified in a few specific ways:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>mode:</strong> current , upcoming, specific, next.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Id:</strong> if specific mode then it’s the event id and if next mode, then it’s the series id.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>size:</strong> integer from 1 to 28 (steps of 35px).</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Pro Tips for Marketing QR Codes</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Here are pro tips to make your QR codes effective:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Test it first: </strong>Make sure your code links to the correct event page! Nothing kills momentum like incorrect links.&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Place them strategically:</strong> Near entrances, registration tables, or session doors– anywhere someone might pause or notice. Think beyond paper, too. QR codes work great on social media posts, digital signage, receipts, name badges, and merch!</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Pair with a call to action:</strong> Use action-oriented language. A QR code with a CTA like “scan to register” or “get the full schedule” can increase engagement.&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Combine with other channels:</strong> Use them in tandem with email, social media, direct mail, or packaging. QR codes shine when they’re part of a broader campaign, not the entire strategy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ready to Add Scanning to Your Event Planning?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>QR codes are your new event sidekick. Let the QR codes do the heavy lifting by connecting your people to all your event details. Less printing, less friction, more engagement.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p>So go ahead: share, scan, and simplify. Your future events (and your attendees) will thank you.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We’ve got even more exciting features on the way, so don’t miss a beat. <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/newsletter-signup/\">Subscribe to our newsletter</a> and stay in the loop!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-in-case-you-missed-it\">In Case You Missed It <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.1.0/72x72/1f50d.png\" alt=\"🔍\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /> <img src=\"https://s.w.org/images/core/emoji/15.1.0/72x72/1f440.png\" alt=\"👀\" class=\"wp-smiley\" style=\"height: 1em; max-height: 1em;\" /></h2>\n\n\n\n<p>We&#8217;re always working to make our product suite better for you. Below are just three, recent examples, of new features we&#8217;ve released that bring new functionality to our products while making your life easier. To see all major feature and product releases, check out our <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/category/blog/news/\">full news feed</a>. If you&#8217;d like to see all product updates, including maintenance and security releases, you can find that information in our <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/category/release-notes/\">release notes</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-embed-your-events-calendar-on-any-external-website\" style=\"padding-bottom:20px\">Embed Your Events Calendar on Any External Website</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-cb90e00a wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/embed-your-events-calendar-on-any-external-website/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"665\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-665x410.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2547581\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-665x410.jpg 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-300x185.jpg 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-138x85.jpg 138w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-768x474.jpg 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-430x265.jpg 430w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-645x398.jpg 645w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-1068x659.jpg 1068w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-460x284.jpg 460w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-1074x663.jpg 1074w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-512x316.jpg 512w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-707x436.jpg 707w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-600x370.jpg 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2-500x309.jpg 500w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/External-Calendar-Embed-64239-v2.jpg 1528w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 665px) 100vw, 665px\" /></a></figure></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p>You can now easily share your full events calendar beyond your main site! With our new embed feature, you can place your calendar on any external website to boost visibility.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns2547928_a9b34d-e1\"><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn2547928_a71959-61 kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/embed-your-events-calendar-on-any-external-website/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">Learn more about Calendar Embeds!</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-offer-discounts-and-increase-sales-with-event-tickets-coupons\" style=\"padding-bottom:20px\">Offer Discounts and Increase Sales with Event Tickets Coupons</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-cb90e00a wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/event-tickets-coupons/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"665\" height=\"410\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-665x410.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2547469\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-665x410.png 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-300x185.png 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-138x85.png 138w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-768x474.png 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-430x265.png 430w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-645x398.png 645w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-1068x659.png 1068w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-460x284.png 460w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-1074x663.png 1074w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-512x316.png 512w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-707x436.png 707w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-600x370.png 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2-500x309.png 500w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Event-Tickets-Coupons-64237-v2.png 1528w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 665px) 100vw, 665px\" /></a></figure></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p>Give your attendees a little extra incentive to click &#8220;buy.&#8221; Our Event Tickets Coupons feature lets you create and manage discount codes directly within your dashboard. It&#8217;s a great way to drive ticket sales and reward your audience.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns2547928_cdb953-6d\"><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn2547928_bebc0c-cc kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/event-tickets-coupons/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">Learn how to create ticket coupons!</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-seating-is-compatible-with-woocommerce\" style=\"padding-bottom:20px\">Seating is Compatible with WooCommerce</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-cb90e00a wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" style=\"padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/seating-compatible-with-woocommerce/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"665\" height=\"411\" src=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-665x411.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2547441\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-665x411.png 665w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-300x186.png 300w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-137x85.png 137w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-768x475.png 768w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1536x950.png 1536w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-2048x1267.png 2048w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-430x266.png 430w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-645x399.png 645w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-2000x1237.png 2000w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1068x661.png 1068w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-460x285.png 460w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1602x991.png 1602w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1074x664.png 1074w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-512x317.png 512w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1611x997.png 1611w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-1781x1102.png 1781w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-707x437.png 707w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-600x371.png 600w, https://images.theeventscalendar.com/uploads/2025/03/Woo-Seating-Featured-Image-64238-01-500x309.png 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 665px) 100vw, 665px\" /></a></figure></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p>You asked, we delivered! Seating now fully integrates with WooCommerce. Sell tickets, choose seats, and process payments with WooCommerce—no add-ons or workarounds required.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns2547928_25494a-c5\"><a class=\"kb-button kt-button button kb-btn2547928_bd8e5d-cd kt-btn-size-standard kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-false wp-block-kadence-singlebtn\" href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/news/seating-compatible-with-woocommerce/\"><span class=\"kt-btn-inner-text\">Learn about WooCommerce for Seating!</span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/blog/qr-codes-are-here-connect-promotional-material-to-your-event-calendar-with-ease/\">QR Codes are Here! Connect Promotional Material to Your Event Calendar with Ease</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com\">The Events Calendar</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}}}i:2;a:6:{s:4:\"data\";s:60:\"\n		\n		\n		\n		\n		\n				\n		\n		\n\n					\n										\n					\n		\n		\n			\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"child\";a:3:{s:0:\"\";a:6:{s:5:\"title\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:22:\"Event Tickets 5.22.0.1\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"link\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:81:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/release-notes/event-tickets/event-tickets-5-22-0-1/\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:7:\"pubDate\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:31:\"Wed, 14 May 2025 21:25:46 +0000\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:2:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Event Tickets\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"release notes\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"guid\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:40:\"https://theeventscalendar.com/?p=2548588\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:11:\"isPermaLink\";s:5:\"false\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:11:\"description\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:557:\"<p>Summary Maintenance Release The latest update of Event Tickets prevents a fatal error if the QR library in common has not been loaded. As always, we recommend testing updates on a staging site first, but it should all be smooth sailing. ✅ Fixes Bugs squashed in this release: 🗣 Translations Updated language files and strings:</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/release-notes/event-tickets/event-tickets-5-22-0-1/\">Event Tickets 5.22.0.1</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com\">The Events Calendar</a>.</p>\n\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:32:\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\";a:1:{s:7:\"creator\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Emily Negroni\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}}s:40:\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\";a:1:{s:7:\"encoded\";a:1:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:2648:\"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.3%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-summary\">Summary</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-normal-font-size\">Maintenance Release</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">The latest update of Event Tickets prevents a fatal error if the QR library in common has not been loaded.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As always, we recommend<a href=\"https://theeventscalendar.com/knowledgebase/k/creating-and-using-a-wordpress-staging-site/\"> testing updates</a> on a staging site first, but it should all be smooth sailing.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div