00a0e tem interesse em um\\u00a0<span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\"><strong>PUERTO RICO<\\/strong><\\/span><br \\/><\\/span><b>Renato<\\/b>\\u00a0tem um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0e tem interesse em um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>Dentro dessa configura\\u00e7\\u00e3o de ofertas e interesses, o sistema ir\\u00e1 possibilitar uma<br \\/>triangula\\u00e7\\u00e3o entre esses participantes atrav\\u00e9s de uma <em>\\\"cadeia de trocas\\u201d<\\/em>.<\\/p>\\n<p>No exemplo acima, o resultado da Math Trade indicaria o seguinte:<\\/p>\\n<p><b>Marcelo<\\/b> entrega seu <strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Renato<\\/b> e recebe o <span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\">SURVIVE<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Lucas<\\/b>.<br \\/><b>Lucas<\\/b> entrega seu <span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\">SURVIVE<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Marcelo<\\/b> e recebe o <strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Renato<\\/b>.<br \\/><b>Renato<\\/b> entrega seu <strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Lucas<\\/b> e recebe o <strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Marcelo<\\/b>.<\\/p>\\n<p>O grande ponto da MATH TRADE \\u00e9 que o algoritmo replica esse processo v\\u00e1rias vezes entre todos os participantes <br \\/>de forma a serem realizadas o maior n\\u00famero de trocas poss\\u00edveis de acordo 