\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"title_text\":\"CADEIA DE TROCAS\",\"description_text\":\"A grande sacada de uma MATH TRADE \\u00e9 a utiliza\\u00e7\\u00e3o desse sistema automatizado que cria uma \\\"cadeia de trocas\\\" na qual voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o estar\\u00e1 trocando jogos diretamente com \\numa pessoa, mas com v\\u00e1rias.\",\"position\":\"left\",\"primary_color\":\"#312A26\",\"icon_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":47,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_bottom_space_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"description_typography_font_family\":\"Work Sans\",\"description_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_weight\":\"normal\",\"description_typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"description_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"description_typography_text_decoration\":\"none\",\"description_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":23,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.55,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"35\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_animation\":\"fadeIn\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor1\",\"description_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor0\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=primary\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-box\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"fcded03\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"33\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b8fbc5d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":25,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a208038\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6955a2c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"insert_url\":\"yes\",\"external_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/videos\\/math-trade-bh\\/1-o-que-e-uma-math-trade.mp4\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"553b8d4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":25,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"288e09e8\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\",\"custom_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1286,\"sizes\":[]},\"custom_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1250,\"sizes\":[]},\"custom_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1300,\"sizes\":[]},\"column_position\":\"stretch\",\"content_position\":\"middle\",\"overflow\":\"hidden\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"top left\",\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"initial\",\"background_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":28.7,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_motion_fx_translateY_direction\":\"negative\",\"background_motion_fx_translateY_speed\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"_title\":\"Why Us\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"60\",\"bottom\":\"60\",\"left\":\"60\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"412870aa\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d2c4603\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"EXEMPLO PR\\u00c1TICO\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor1\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a3ee4c5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><b>Marcelo<\\/b>\\u00a0tem um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0e tem interesse em um\\u00a0<span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong>SURVIVE<\\/strong><\\/span><br \\/><\\/span><b>Lucas<\\/b>\\u00a0tem um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\">SURVIVE<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0e tem interesse em um\\u00a0<span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\"><strong>PUERTO RICO<\\/strong><\\/span><br \\/><\\/span><b>Renato<\\/b>\\u00a0tem um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0e tem interesse em um\\u00a0<span style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span><\\/p>\\n<p>Dentro dessa configura\\u00e7\\u00e3o de ofertas e interesses, n\\u00e3o existe uma boa troca direta entre dois deles. <br \\/><br \\/>O sistema da Math Trade ir\\u00e1 possibilitar uma triangula\\u00e7\\u00e3o entre esses participantes atrav\\u00e9s de uma <em>\\\"cadeia de trocas\\u201d\\u00a0<\\/em>de forma que os participantes obtenham jogos que tem interesse e entreguem jogos que n\\u00e3o querem manter.<br \\/><br \\/>No exemplo acima, o resultado da Math Trade indicaria o seguinte:<\\/p>\\n<p><b>Marcelo<\\/b> entrega seu <strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Renato<\\/b> e recebe o <span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\">SURVIVE<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Lucas<\\/b>.<br \\/><b>Lucas<\\/b> entrega seu <span style=\\\"color: #0000ff;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-primary bold\\\">SURVIVE<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Marcelo<\\/b> e recebe o <strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Renato<\\/b>.<br \\/><b>Renato<\\/b> entrega seu <strong><span class=\\\"text-warning bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">PUERTO RICO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0para\\u00a0<b>Lucas<\\/b> e recebe o <strong><span class=\\\"text-success bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #008000;\\\">TIKAL<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0do\\u00a0<b>Marcelo<\\/b>.<\\/p>\\n<p>O grande ponto da MATH TRADE \\u00e9 que o algoritmo replica esse processo v\\u00e1rias vezes entre todos os participantes <br \\/>de forma a serem realizadas o maior n\\u00famero de trocas poss\\u00edveis de acordo com os interesses de cada um.<br \\/>Em uma Math Trade com 60 participantes por exemplo, podemos ter cadeias de trocas envolvendo, 10, 20 ou at\\u00e9 mais participantes.\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor0\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4c5f8ef\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"15232ef\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4483f2c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5ae6d0c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2e3a8c6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"O QUE \\u00c9 PRECISO PARA PARTICIPAR?\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor1\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"89eec75\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul>\\n<li>Ter cadastro no site\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/boardgamegeek.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">BoardGameGeek (BGG)\\u00a0<\\/a>para adicionar seus jogos na lista de trocas da MT.<\\/li>\\n<li>Conhecer e estar de acordo com todas as regras da MATH TRADE em que ir\\u00e1 participar.\\n<ul>\\n<li>Isto inclui, por exemplo, estar dentro da \\u00e1rea de cobertura ou atender os requisitos de retirada\\/entrega dos jogos estabelecida de acordo com cada Math Trade<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li>Se comprometer com os prazos e datas de cada etapa da Math Trade.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"abf81d2\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a190e07\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"INFORMA\\u00c7\\u00d5ES IMPORTANTES\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6976de8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"mb-3\\\">Voc\\u00ea\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"danger bold\\\" style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\">NUNCA<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0ser\\u00e1 obrigado a trocar nenhum jogo que colocou na lista durante a primeira etapa. Se n\\u00e3o quiser troc\\u00e1-lo, basta n\\u00e3o marcar nenhum jogo para trocar com ele nas etapas seguintes.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"mb-3\\\">Voc\\u00ea s\\u00f3 vai receber os jogos que escolheu. N\\u00e3o existe a possibilidade de receber algo que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o tenha marcado na etapa de escolha de jogos.\\u00a0<b>Ent\\u00e3o fique extremamente atento nessa etapa.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/b><\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"mb-3\\\">A troca \\u00e9 sempre um por um, ou seja, um item seu por outro item de outra pessoa. Para aumentar o valor de um item, muitos participantes montam kits\\/combos em um \\u00fanico item. <span class=\\\"small fst-italic\\\">(Entenda melhor essa op\\u00e7\\u00e3o no tutorial).<br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"mb-3\\\"><b>IMPORTANTE:<\\/b> Uma vez que voc\\u00ea tenha participado de todas as etapas, feito sele\\u00e7\\u00f5es de trocas e o algoritimo der o resultado com um de seus jogos, voc\\u00ea <span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"danger bold\\\">N\\u00c3O<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0poder\\u00e1 desistir da troca.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
