itor\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Em Julho de 2021, depois de dois anos sem MATH TRADE (MT) em Belo Horizonte, o BGBH trouxe de volta essa tradi\\u00e7\\u00e3o para a cidade.<br>Mas antes de tudo, o que \\u00e9 uma Math Trade? Vamos te ajudar a entender um pouco sobre esse evento.<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Roboto\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_shadow_text_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"text_shadow_text_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":0,\"blur\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor0\"},\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"20133bbc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1340,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap\":\"no\",\"custom_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1440,\"sizes\":[]},\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"4\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"26\",\"right\":\"8\",\"bottom\":\"26\",\"left\":\"8\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_element_id\":\"services\",\"_title\":\"Services\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"},\"animation\":\"fadeIn\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2b8f7f0f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"pad