ditor\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">Em Julho de 2021, depois de dois anos sem MATH TRADE (MT) em Belo Horizonte, o BGBH trouxe de volta essa tradi\\u00e7\\u00e3o para a cidade.<br>Mas antes de tudo, o que \\u00e9 uma Math Trade? Vamos te ajudar a entender um pouco sobre esse evento.<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Roboto\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_shadow_text_shadow_type\":\"yes\",\"text_shadow_text_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":0,\"blur\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor0\"},\"_element_width\":\"inherit\",\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"20133bbc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1340,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap\":\"narrow\",\"custom_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1440,\"sizes\":[]},\"structure\":\"20\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"16\",\"right\":\"4\",\"bottom\":\"16\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"26\",\"right\":\"8\",\"bottom\":\"26\",\"left\":\"8\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_title\":\"Services\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"},\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"content_position\":\"middle\",\"animation\":\"fadeIn\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2b8f7f0f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"35\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"934735\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"\",\"library\":\"\"},\"title_text\":\"O QUE \\u00c9 UMA MATH TRADE?\",\"description_text\":\"MATH TRADE \\u00e9 um evento voltado para troca de jogos. Uma grande oportunidade para trocar um jogo seu por um jogo de outra pessoa a partir de triangula\\u00e7\\u00f5es geradas por um algoritmo programado para maximizar a quantidade de trocas entre os participantes.\",\"position\":\"left\",\"primary_color\":\"#312A26\",\"icon_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":47,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_bottom_space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_bottom_space_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"description_typography_font_family\":\"Work Sans\",\"description_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_font_weight\":\"normal\",\"description_typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"description_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"description_typography_text_decoration\":\"none\",\"description_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":23,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.55,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"to