:\"1c15b5c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"006b593\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO ITENS VARIADOS EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e2661b6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">LIVROS DE RPG e ACESS\\u00d3RIOS<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0relacionados a boardgames como itens de troca. Antes de adicionar esses itens, consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">DINHEIRO<\\/span><\\/strong>, como item de troca.\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Isto n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 uma pr\\u00e1tica habitual da <strong>Math Trade Belo Horizonte.<\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0Caso tenha d\\u00favidas sobre a libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o desse item consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"81187bc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"10270be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-clone\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
