(1248, 273, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"f0f2d9e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7326930\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"403ad58\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/imagem-topo.png\",\"id\":77,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3fe37a7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6e4395b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2278ca6b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7dddbcb1\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7a67bc22\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><!-- wp:image {\\\"align\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"id\\\":77,\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"large\\\",\\\"linkDestination\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"is-style-default\\\"} --><\\/p>\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image alignfull size-large is-style-default\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 2rem; font-style: inherit; font-weight: 600; background-color: var(--ast-global-color-5);\\\">REGRAS GERAIS DE UMA MATH TRADE<\\/span><\\/figure>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<p><!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">Antes da apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o das regras, esteja sempre ciente que os organizadores e moderadores da Math Trade n\\u00e3o possuem nenhuma responsabilidade sobre as trocas, entregas e estado geral dos jogos ofertados.<\\/mark><\\/strong><br \\/>A fun\\u00e7\\u00e3o deles \\u00e9 organizar as informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es da Math Trade, esclarecer eventuais d\\u00favidas, rodar o sistema respons\\u00e1vel pelas trocas e resolver em parceria com os participantes qualquer eventual contratempo ocorrido na Math Trade. O sucesso e experi\\u00eancia positiva de todos depende do compromisso e bom senso de cada um.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p><!-- wp:columns {\\\"verticalAlignment\\\":null,\\\"style\\\":{\\\"border\\\":{\\\"width\\\":\\\"5px\\\",\\\"radius\\\":\\\"0px\\\"},\\\"color\\\":{\\\"background\\\":\\\"#e3e3e3\\\"}}} --><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-columns has-background\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 5px; border-radius: 0px; background-color: #e3e3e3;\\\">\\n<p><!-- wp:column {\\\"verticalAlignment\\\":\\\"center\\\"} --><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\\\">\\n<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\"} --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"has-text-align-center\\\">IMPORTANTE<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:column --><\\/p>\\n<p><!-- wp:column --><\\/p>\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column\\\">\\n<p><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"align\\\":\\\"center\\\"} --><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center\\\"><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">O sistema NUNCA ir\\u00e1 fazer uma troca que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o tenha selecionado. Por esse motivo fique atento no momento de fazer a sua marca\\u00e7\\u00e3o na segunda etapa. <\\/mark><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-0-color\\\" style=\\\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\\\">Caso o resultado final seja a troca de um jogo que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o reconhe\\u00e7a, tenha certeza que por algum descuido da sua parte esse jogo foi marcado e voc\\u00ea dever\\u00e1 honrar sua troca.<\\/mark><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:column --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:columns --><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bf51823\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7cf196f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07cf1c3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a435863\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c59ea29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a982227\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-plus-square\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d77ed30\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"be8fe44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO BOARDGAMES EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4da13e4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Verifique a condi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de conserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o de seu jogo antes de coloc\\u00e1-lo na lista. (Estado da caixa, componentes desgastados ou ausentes, se possui marcas ou cheiro de mofo, etc)\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Em caso de problemas, descreva-os no seu item!<\\/span><br \\/><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Exemplos comuns: tampa abaulada, insert quebrado, cartas sujas nas laterais, cartas tortas devido ao armazenamento, faces dos dados apagadas, passou por tratamento por mofo, jogo sem o insert original (algumas pessoas n\\u00e3o aceitam jogos sem o insert original), etc... DESCREVA TUDO MESMO!<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li>Evite textos longos e outras formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es na Geeklist. (Ao sincronizar com o OLWLG, algumas formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es n\\u00e3o aparecem corretamente, dificultando a leitura de todos).<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ec6c405\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6c74efc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"48ff259\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-plus-square\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"eed4539\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a636e40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO BOARDGAMES EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"3ced36e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Verifique a condi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de conserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o de seu jogo antes de coloc\\u00e1-lo na lista. (Estado da caixa, componentes desgastados ou ausentes, se possui marcas ou cheiro de mofo, etc)\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Em caso de problemas, descreva-os no seu item!<\\/span><br \\/><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Exemplos comuns: tampa abaulada, insert quebrado, cartas sujas nas laterais, cartas tortas devido ao armazenamento, faces dos dados apagadas, passou por tratamento por mofo, jogo sem o insert original (algumas pessoas n\\u00e3o aceitam jogos sem o insert original), etc... DESCREVA TUDO MESMO!<\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li>Evite textos longos e outras formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es na Geeklist. (Ao sincronizar com o OLWLG, algumas formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es n\\u00e3o aparecem corretamente, dificultando a leitura de todos).<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6e63273\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b49d147\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd5dc7c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f301b83\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"22\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1c15b5c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"006b593\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO ITENS VARIADOS EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e2661b6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">LIVROS DE RPG e ACESS\\u00d3RIOS<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0relacionados a boardgames como itens de troca. Antes de adicionar esses itens, consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">DINHEIRO<\\/span><\\/strong>, como item de troca.\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Isto n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 uma pr\\u00e1tica habitual da <strong>Math Trade Belo Horizonte.<\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0Caso tenha d\\u00favidas sobre a libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o desse item consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"81187bc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"10270be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-clone\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
