\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3e21cfe\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4571bce\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bd262f7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image alignfull size-large is-style-default\\\"><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\">Antes da apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o das regras, esteja sempre ciente que os organizadores e moderadores da Math Trade n\\u00e3o possuem nenhuma responsabilidade sobre as trocas, entregas e estado geral dos jogos ofertados.<\\/mark><\\/strong><\\/figure>\\n<p>A fun\\u00e7\\u00e3o deles \\u00e9 organizar as informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es da Math Trade, esclarecer eventuais d\\u00favidas, rodar o sistema respons\\u00e1vel pelas trocas e resolver em parceria com os participantes qualquer eventual contratempo ocorrido na Math Trade. O sucesso e experi\\u00eancia positiva de todos depende do compromisso e bom senso de cada um.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"202518f\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_border\":\"none\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5681199\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#E7E7E7\",\"border_border\":\"groove\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8279aec\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a0129a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_in