ected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-clone\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3b96d4e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0395562\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b90c97\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"316c41b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eb7350e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":6.051,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"984915a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"align\":\"right\",\"__globals__\":{\"primary_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"21f8724\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":93.614,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fa14038\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"PR\\u00c1TICAS PROIBIDAS\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6c073f5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a5cfc7\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07da345\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_list\":[{\"text\":\"Listar itens que atentem contras as normas do BoardGameGeek (jogos piratas ou homemade)\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-thumbs-down\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"},\"_id\":\"3c9a16f\"},{\"text\":\"Listar itens que n\\u00e3o sejam relacionados a jogos de tabuleiro ou liberados na descri\\u00e7\\u00e3o de cada Math Trade. Exemplo: DVDs, computadores, ve\\u00edculos, etc.\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-thumbs-down\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"},\"_id\":\"ae12612\"}],\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_align\":\"left\",\"divider_weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"divider_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_self_align\":\"right\",\"icon_self_align_tablet\":\"right\",\"icon_self_align_mobile\":\"right\",\"text_indent\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"icon_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-list\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"25abd84\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ca9c268\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b98376\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"0a6ded5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color_b_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":63,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":270,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5b54ead\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a84302c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6deec3a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2434116\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"TERMOS DE RESPONSABILIDADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1835212\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>A organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o <span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"bold text-danger\\\">N\\u00c3O<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0se responsabiliza pelas trocas, entregas e estado dos jogos.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li>Erros cometidos por voc\\u00ea\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">n\\u00e3o invalidam os resultados<\\/span><\\/strong>. Voc\\u00ea deve honrar suas trocas mesmo se voc\\u00ea cometer algum erro.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li><strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">Revise cuidadosamente sua lista de desejos<\\/span>\\u00a0e os itens nela antes de submet\\u00ea-la.<\\/strong> Voc\\u00ea pode mud\\u00e1-la quantas vezes quiser e precisar antes do final da etapa de submiss\\u00e3o das listas de desejos.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li>N\\u00e3o adicione \\u00e0 sua lista de desejos algum item que esteja com a\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>descri\\u00e7\\u00e3o faltante ou duvidosa<\\/strong>,<\\/span>\\u00a0sem todos os dados necess\\u00e1rios. Busque sempre o esclarecimento dessas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es antes de selecionar esses itens. <strong>Caso voc\\u00ea o fa\\u00e7a,\\u00a0<\\/strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>estar\\u00e1 assumindo o \\u00f4nus de receber um item \\\"no escuro\\\"<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1ecdd5c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6068766\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"78e5ff0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2eee1cc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"14eccab\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"63e6f5a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"ENTREGAS - GERAL\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><strong>Cada Math Trade possui regras espec\\u00edficas para entrega<\\/strong>. Algumas definem um dia e local para que todos fa\\u00e7am as trocas presencialmente, outras definem um prazo para o envio utilizando algum servi\\u00e7o de entrega, como transportadoras e correios. Por esse motivo <strong>fique atento \\u00e0s especifica\\u00e7\\u00f5es de entrega que cada MATH TRADE possui.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u00c9 necess\\u00e1rio o comprometimento de entregar os jogos determinados pelo resultado do algoritmo respeitando a escolha daqueles que ir\\u00e3o receber seus jogos.<\\/p><p>Se n\\u00e3o puder cumprir esses requisitos, por favor, n\\u00e3o entre na Math Trade!<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"f9f0c67\"},{\"tab_title\":\"ENTREGAS - ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS MATH TRADE BH\",\"tab_content\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>No caso da Math Trade BH \\u00e9 obrigat\\u00f3rio que todos os participantes tenham pelo menos\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">um ponto de entrega dentro de Belo Horizonte para receber os jogos<br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/li><li>Voc\\u00ea estar\\u00e1 assumindo a responsabilidade de\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>entregar o jogo na forma determinada e no local determinado<\\/strong>,\\u00a0<\\/span>seja diretamente para o participante ou no ponto de entrega oficial. <em>(Fique sempre atento a mudan\\u00e7as espec\\u00edficas que podem ocorrer em uma edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o, sempre descritas nas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es gerais da edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o)<br \\/><br \\/><\\/em><\\/li><li>Assim como nas regras gerais de entrega,\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">se n\\u00e3o puder cumprir esses requisitos, por favor, n\\u00e3o entre nessa Math Trade!<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"_id\":\"d86cea8\"}]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"tabs\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"922891b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dbf029d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4d1cf40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
