(1458, 305, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"f0f2d9e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7326930\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"space_between_widgets\":0,\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"403ad58\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/imagem-topo.png\",\"id\":77,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3fe37a7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6e4395b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0bb47cd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1a4df32\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e32889b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1c1946c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"REGRAS GERAIS DE UMA MATH TRADE\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a47a690\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bf654a4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"29cb444\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3e21cfe\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4571bce\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bd262f7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image alignfull size-large is-style-default\\\"><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\">Antes da apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o das regras, esteja sempre ciente que os organizadores e moderadores da Math Trade n\\u00e3o possuem nenhuma responsabilidade sobre as trocas, entregas e estado geral dos jogos ofertados.<\\/mark><\\/strong><\\/figure>\\n<p>A fun\\u00e7\\u00e3o deles \\u00e9 organizar as informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es da Math Trade, esclarecer eventuais d\\u00favidas, rodar o sistema respons\\u00e1vel pelas trocas e resolver em parceria com os participantes qualquer eventual contratempo ocorrido na Math Trade. O sucesso e experi\\u00eancia positiva de todos depende do compromisso e bom senso de cada um.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"202518f\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_border\":\"none\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5681199\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#E7E7E7\",\"border_border\":\"groove\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8279aec\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"20\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a0129a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":30,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d5ece95\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"IMPORTANTE!\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ab5f5fe\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":70,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e5a102\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\">O sistema NUNCA ir\\u00e1 fazer uma troca que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o tenha selecionado. Por esse motivo fique atento no momento de fazer a sua marca\\u00e7\\u00e3o na segunda etapa.\\u00a0<\\/mark><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-0-color\\\">Caso o resultado final seja a troca de um jogo que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o reconhe\\u00e7a, tenha certeza que por algum descuido da sua parte esse jogo foi marcado e voc\\u00ea dever\\u00e1 honrar sua troca.<\\/mark><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bf51823\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7cf196f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07cf1c3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a435863\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c59ea29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a982227\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-plus-square\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d77ed30\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"be8fe44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO BOARDGAMES EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4da13e4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Verifique a condi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de conserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o de seu jogo antes de coloc\\u00e1-lo na lista. <em>(Estado da caixa, componentes desgastados ou ausentes, se possui marcas ou cheiro de mofo, etc).<\\/em>\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">Em caso de problemas, descreva-os no seu item!<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\"><em>Exemplos comuns: tampa abaulada, insert quebrado, cartas sujas nas laterais, cartas tortas devido ao armazenamento, faces dos dados apagadas, passou por tratamento por mofo, jogo sem o insert original (algumas pessoas n\\u00e3o aceitam jogos sem o insert original), etc...<\\/em> DESCREVA TUDO MESMO!<br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li>Evite textos longos e outras formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es na Geeklist. (Ao sincronizar com o OLWLG, algumas formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es n\\u00e3o aparecem corretamente, dificultando a leitura de todos).<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6e63273\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b49d147\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd5dc7c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f301b83\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"22\",\"reverse_order_tablet\":\"reverse-tablet\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1c15b5c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"006b593\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO ITENS VARIADOS EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e2661b6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">LIVROS DE RPG e ACESS\\u00d3RIOS<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0relacionados a boardgames como itens de troca. Antes de adicionar esses itens, consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li>\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">DINHEIRO<\\/span><\\/strong>, como item de troca.\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Isto n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 uma pr\\u00e1tica habitual da <strong>Math Trade Belo Horizonte.<\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0Caso tenha d\\u00favidas sobre a libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o desse item consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"81187bc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"10270be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"sel