ture\":\"20\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"10\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a0129a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":30,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d5ece95\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"IMPORTANTE!\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"ab5f5fe\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":70,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e5a102\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-7-color\\\">O sistema NUNCA ir\\u00e1 fazer uma troca que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o tenha selecionado. Por esse motivo fique atento no momento de fazer a sua marca\\u00e7\\u00e3o na segunda etapa.\\u00a0<\\/mark><mark class=\\\"has-inline-color has-ast-global-color-0-color\\\">Caso o resultado final seja a troca de um jogo que voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o reconhe\\u00e7a, tenha certeza que por algum descuido da sua parte esse jogo foi marcado e voc\\u00ea dever\\u00e1 honrar sua troca.<\\/mark><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bf51823\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7cf196f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07cf1c3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a435863\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c59ea29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a982227\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-plus-square\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d77ed30\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"be8fe44\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO BOARDGAMES EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4da13e4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Verifique a condi\\u00e7\\u00e3o de conserva\\u00e7\\u00e3o de seu jogo antes de coloc\\u00e1-lo na lista. <em>(Estado da caixa, componentes desgastados ou ausentes, se possui marcas ou cheiro de mofo, etc).<\\/em>\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">Em caso de problemas, descreva-os no seu item!<\\/span><\\/strong><br \\/><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\"><em>Exemplos comuns: tampa abaulada, insert quebrado, cartas sujas nas laterais, cartas tortas devido ao armazenamento, faces dos dados apagadas, passou por tratamento por mofo, jogo sem o insert original (algumas pessoas n\\u00e3o aceitam jogos sem o insert original), etc...<\\/em> DESCREVA TUDO MESMO!<br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/li>\\n<li>Evite textos longos e outras formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es na Geeklist. (Ao sincronizar com o OLWLG, algumas formata\\u00e7\\u00f5es n\\u00e3o aparecem corretamente, dificultando a leitura de todos).<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6e63273\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b49d147\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd5dc7c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f301b83\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"22\",\"reverse_order_tablet\":\"reverse-tablet\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1c15b5c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"006b593\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"ADICIONANDO ITENS VARIADOS EM UMA MATH TRADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e2661b6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">LIVROS DE RPG e ACESS\\u00d3RIOS<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0relacionados a boardgames como itens de troca. Antes de adicionar esses itens, consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li>\\n<li>Algumas Math Trades permitem que os participantes adicionem\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">DINHEIRO<\\/span><\\/strong>, como item de troca.\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Isto n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 uma pr\\u00e1tica habitual da <strong>Math Trade Belo Horizonte.<\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0Caso tenha d\\u00favidas sobre a libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o desse item consulte as regras espec\\u00edficas de cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"81187bc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"10270be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-clone\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3b96d4e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0395562\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b90c97\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"316c41b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"21\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eb7350e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":6.051,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"984915a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-exclamation-triangle\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"align\":\"right\",\"__globals__\":{\"primary_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"21f8724\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":66,\"_inline_size\":93.614,\"content_position\":\"center\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fa14038\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"PR\\u00c1TICAS PROIBIDAS\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6c073f5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6a5cfc7\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"07da345\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_list\":[{\"text\":\"Listar itens que atentem contras as normas do BoardGameGeek (jogos piratas ou homemade)\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-thumbs-down\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"},\"_id\":\"3c9a16f\"},{\"text\":\"Listar itens que n\\u00e3o sejam relacionados a jogos de tabuleiro ou liberados na descri\\u00e7\\u00e3o de cada Math Trade. Exemplo: DVDs, computadores, ve\\u00edculos, etc.\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"far fa-thumbs-down\",\"library\":\"fa-regular\"},\"_id\":\"ae12612\"}],\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_align\":\"left\",\"divider_weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"divider_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_self_align\":\"right\",\"icon_self_align_tablet\":\"right\",\"icon_self_align_mobile\":\"right\",\"text_indent\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"icon_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\",\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-list\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"25abd84\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ca9c268\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b98376\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"0a6ded5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color_b_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":63,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\",\"background_color_b\":\"globals\\/colors?id=secondary\"},\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":270,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5b54ead\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a84302c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6deec3a\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2434116\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"TERMOS DE RESPONSABILIDADE\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1835212\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>A organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o <span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"bold text-danger\\\">N\\u00c3O<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/span>\\u00a0se responsabiliza pelas trocas, entregas e estado dos jogos.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li>Erros cometidos por voc\\u00ea\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">n\\u00e3o invalidam os resultados<\\/span><\\/strong>. Voc\\u00ea deve honrar suas trocas mesmo se voc\\u00ea cometer algum erro.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li><strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">Revise cuidadosamente sua lista de desejos<\\/span>\\u00a0e os itens nela antes de submet\\u00ea-la.<\\/strong> Voc\\u00ea pode mud\\u00e1-la quantas vezes quiser e precisar antes do final da etapa de submiss\\u00e3o das listas de desejos.<br \\/><br \\/><\\/li><li>N\\u00e3o adicione \\u00e0 sua lista de desejos algum item que esteja com a\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>descri\\u00e7\\u00e3o faltante ou duvidosa<\\/strong>,<\\/span>\\u00a0sem todos os dados necess\\u00e1rios. Busque sempre o esclarecimento dessas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es antes de selecionar esses itens. <strong>Caso voc\\u00ea o fa\\u00e7a,\\u00a0<\\/strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>estar\\u00e1 assumindo o \\u00f4nus de receber um item \\\"no escuro\\\"<\\/strong>.<\\/span><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor5\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"1ecdd5c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6068766\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"78e5ff0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2eee1cc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"14eccab\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"63e6f5a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"ENTREGAS - GERAL\",\"tab_content\":\"<p><strong>Cada Math Trade possui regras espec\\u00edficas para entrega<\\/strong>. Algumas definem um dia e local para que todos fa\\u00e7am as trocas presencialmente, outras definem um prazo para o envio utilizando algum servi\\u00e7o de entrega, como transportadoras e correios. Por esse motivo <strong>fique atento \\u00e0s especifica\\u00e7\\u00f5es de entrega que cada MATH TRADE possui.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u00c9 necess\\u00e1rio o comprometimento de entregar os jogos determinados pelo resultado do algoritmo respeitando a escolha daqueles que ir\\u00e3o receber seus jogos.<\\/p><p>Se n\\u00e3o puder cumprir esses requisitos, por favor, n\\u00e3o entre na Math Trade!<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"f9f0c67\"},{\"tab_title\":\"ENTREGAS - ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS MATH TRADE BH\",\"tab_content\":\"<ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>No caso da Math Trade BH \\u00e9 obrigat\\u00f3rio que todos os participantes tenham pelo menos\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">um ponto de entrega dentro de Belo Horizonte para receber os jogos<br \\/><br \\/><\\/span><\\/strong><\\/li><li>Voc\\u00ea estar\\u00e1 assumindo a responsabilidade de\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>entregar o jogo na forma determinada e no local determinado<\\/strong>,\\u00a0<\\/span>seja diretamente para o participante ou no ponto de entrega oficial. <em>(Fique sempre atento a mudan\\u00e7as espec\\u00edficas que podem ocorrer em uma edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o, sempre descritas nas informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es gerais da edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o)<br \\/><br \\/><\\/em><\\/li><li>Assim como nas regras gerais de entrega,\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">se n\\u00e3o puder cumprir esses requisitos, por favor, n\\u00e3o entre nessa Math Trade!<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"_id\":\"d86cea8\"}]},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"tabs\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"922891b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dbf029d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4d1cf40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
