eiro em uma Math Trade DEVE criar uma venda no Geek Market e imediatamente marcar o item como VENDIDO. A plataforma ir\\u00e1 calcular a taxa de 3% do valor e indicar\\u00e1 o montante que dever\\u00e1 ser pago pelo usu\\u00e1rio - atualmente, a \\u00fanica forma de fazer esse pagamento \\u00e9 via PayPal.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"54ab224\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b886b69\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fa2d74\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"1. Colocar um item para venda no Geek Market\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"87d475d\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bbebaf9\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"44904c6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.05.19.jpeg\",\"id\":344,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"title_text\":\"Isto \\u00e9 o t\\u00edtulo\",\"description_text\":\"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\",\"position\":\"left\",\"image_size\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-box\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
