eiro em uma Math Trade DEVE criar uma venda no Geek Market e imediatamente marcar o item como VENDIDO. A plataforma ir\\u00e1 calcular a taxa de 3% do valor e indicar\\u00e1 o montante que dever\\u00e1 ser pago pelo usu\\u00e1rio - atualmente, a \\u00fanica forma de fazer esse pagamento \\u00e9 via PayPal.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"54ab224\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b886b69\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fa2d74\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"1. Criar uma venda no Geek Market\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"aa72ff1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>V\\u00e1 para a p\\u00e1gina do jogo que trocou e clique em \\\"Shopping\\\"<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e02e03b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.07.37.jpeg\",\"id\":349,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"afd5e40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Depois, clique no bot\\u00e3o azul \\\"+ Sell\\\", no canto direito.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f88a3d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.06.31.jpeg\",\"id\":351,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a6558c7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\