(1807, 372, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"76953f6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6268f0f\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b72c436\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/imagem-topo.png\",\"id\":77,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"7095a82\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1e0a148\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b165fc3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"31a899e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"af138ca\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2bfc38d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"TROCA ENVOLVENDO DINHEIRO EM MATH TRADES\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e2afb53\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d7d3af2\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"aace7d3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"170ca7a\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b99e758\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8607239\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong>TODA<\\/strong> troca envolvendo dinheiro em Math Trades \\u00e9 considerada uma <strong>venda<\\/strong> no BGG, e como tal, est\\u00e1 sujeita a uma comiss\\u00e3o do site. Atualmente, 3% do valor recebido.<\\/span><\\/p><p><span style=\\\"color: #333333;\\\">Vamos explicar o processo do que deve ser feito caso voc\\u00ea tenha <strong>RECEBIDO<\\/strong> um item de dinheiro em alguma de suas trocas.<\\/span><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"552c3bb\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"629f0fe\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e39cafc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"COMO FAZER UMA VENDA NO BOARD GAME GEEK (BGG)\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e1714f6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d3252bb\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"82aa4f8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>O BGG tem uma plataforma pr\\u00f3pria para seu mercado de jogos (compra e venda), \\u00e9 o <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/boardgamegeek.com\\/market?pageid=1\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\"><strong>Geek Market<\\/strong><\\/a>.<br \\/>Existem diferentes forma de colocar itens a venda no Geek Market. Aqui, vamos focar no processo da Math Trade e fazer uma simula\\u00e7\\u00e3o seguindo um processo que consideramos mais r\\u00e1pido e pr\\u00e1tico, feito pelo computador.<\\/p><p>Em resumo, o usu\\u00e1rio que RECEBER um item de dinheiro em uma Math Trade DEVE criar uma venda no Geek Market e imediatamente marcar o item como VENDIDO. A plataforma ir\\u00e1 calcular a taxa de 3% do valor e indicar\\u00e1 o montante que dever\\u00e1 ser pago pelo usu\\u00e1rio - atualmente, a \\u00fanica forma de fazer esse pagamento \\u00e9 via PayPal.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"54ab224\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b886b69\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fa2d74\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"1. Criar uma venda no Geek Market\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"aa72ff1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>V\\u00e1 para a p\\u00e1gina do jogo que trocou e clique em \\\"Shopping\\\"<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e02e03b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.07.37.jpeg\",\"id\":349,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"afd5e40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Depois, clique no bot\\u00e3o azul \\\"+ Sell\\\", no canto direito.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f88a3d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.06.31.jpeg\",\"id\":351,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a6558c7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":