heiro em uma Math Trade DEVE criar uma venda no Geek Market e imediatamente marcar o item como VENDIDO. A plataforma ir\\u00e1 calcular a taxa de 3% do valor e indicar\\u00e1 o montante que dever\\u00e1 ser pago pelo usu\\u00e1rio - atualmente, a \\u00fanica forma de fazer esse pagamento \\u00e9 via PayPal.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"54ab224\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b886b69\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fa2d74\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"1. Criar uma venda no Geek Market\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"aa72ff1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>V\\u00e1 para a p\\u00e1gina do jogo que trocou e clique em \\\"Shopping\\\"<\\/p>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"e02e03b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.07.37.jpeg\",\"id\":349,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"afd5e40\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Depois, clique no bot\\u00e3o azul \\\"+ Sell\\\", no canto direito.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f88a3d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-20-at-17.06.31.jpeg\",\"id\":351,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a6558c7\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c6ecc56\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"032c48c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"1.1 Preencher os detalhes da venda\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c89ef01\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Agora voc\\u00ea estar\\u00e1 dentro do Geek Market. Perceba que o jogo j\\u00e1 estar\\u00e1 selecionado ( Campo <strong>\\\"Select Item\\\"<\\/strong>).<\\/p><p>Clique em <strong>\\\"Select Currency\\\"<\\/strong> para escolher a moeda. Sugerimos U.S. Dollars. <br \\/>No campo ao lado, <strong>\\\"Price\\\"<\\/strong>, coloque o valor que recebeu convertido de real para dolar.<br \\/><em>Ex. Considerando a convers\\u00e3o do momento do print, R$200 = $38,70.<\\/em><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"31c2b62\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.08.48.jpeg\",\"id\":354,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"1533706\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;\\\">Em\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">\\\"Condition\\\"<\\/span>, selecione qualquer op\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/p><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400;\\\">Em\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">\\\"Quantity\\\"<\\/span>, n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 preciso altera\\u00e7\\u00e3o. Mantenha a op\\u00e7\\u00e3o \\\"One time\\\" que j\\u00e1 vai estar selecionada.<\\/p><p>Em <strong>\\\"Notes\\\"<\\/strong>, escreva que foi um <em>item trocado por dinheiro em uma Math Trade.<\\/em><\\/p><p>No campo <strong>\\\"Payments\\\"<\\/strong>, marque a op\\u00e7\\u00e3o <strong>\\\"See Notes\\\".<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Na caixa de sele\\u00e7\\u00e3o <strong>\\\"Ship to Location\\\"<\\/strong>, selecione <strong>\\\"will ship worldwide\\\".<br \\/><\\/strong><\\/p><p>Depois, clique no bot\\u00e3o azul <strong>\\\"Submit\\\"<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"d01a24f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.13.05.jpeg\",\"id\":355,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4bc3df4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"03424f9\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f3bdb97\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"2. Marcar o item como vendido\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"5d41095\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Pronto. Sua venda est\\u00e1 criada e voc\\u00ea ver\\u00e1 uma p\\u00e1gina semelhante a imagem abaixo. <br \\/>Confira os dados e clique no bot\\u00e3o <strong>\\\"Mark Sold\\\"<\\/strong> para marcar o item como <strong>VENDIDO<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"12135d7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.16.09.jpeg\",\"id\":356,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"5f49c62\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Confirme a venda, clicando no bot\\u00e3o <strong>\\\"Mark Sold\\\"<\\/strong> no popup que abrir.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"7b10b26\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.16.46.jpeg\",\"id\":357,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"8605eb8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>A simula\\u00e7\\u00e3o da venda foi concretizada. Voc\\u00ea ver\\u00e1 os detalhes da venda <em>(total)<\\/em> e o valor da comiss\\u00e3o que dever\\u00e1 ser paga <em>(Advertising fee)<\\/em><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"dc83770\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.17.39.jpeg\",\"id\":358,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"50015fc\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9e757f8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dbfba22\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"3. Visualizar as taxas\",\"header_size\":\"h4\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"8d4c7b5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>No menu lateral, clique em \\\"<strong>Ad Fees\\\"<\\/strong> e voc\\u00ea ver\\u00e1 as taxas que tem que pagar.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ba57c88\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-21-at-10.43.34.jpeg\",\"id\":359,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"aca5d3d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\">ATEN\\u00c7\\u00c3O!<br \\/><\\/span><\\/strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\">Somente quando a soma de todas as suas taxas for igual ou maior do que $2.00 (dois d\\u00f3lares) ser\\u00e1 disponibilizado um bot\\u00e3o para pagamento delas.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_border_border\":\"solid\",\"_border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"6\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"__globals__\":{\"_border_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor7\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"ecf5587\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Perceba que n\\u00e3o \\u00e9 o valor de uma taxa superar os $2.00 mas sim a soma de todas.<br \\/><br \\/>Vamos considerar um exemplo, e para simplificar, consideremos <strong>$1,00 = R$5,00.<\\/strong><br \\/><span style=\\\"background-color: var(--ast-global-color-5); color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-style: inherit;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: inherit;\\\">Manuel trocou um item na Math Trade por um <strong>PIX de R$200<\\/strong>. Ele vai criar uma venda no valor de <strong>$40,00<\\/strong> e a taxa de comiss\\u00e3o do BGG vai ser <strong>$1.20<\\/strong>.<\\/span><br \\/><\\/span><strong style=\\\"font-style: inherit; color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; background-color: var(--ast-global-color-5);\\\">Ele ainda n\\u00e3o ter\\u00e1 que fazer o pagamento dessa taxa.<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Posteriormente, em outra Math Trade ele fez outra troca, dessa vez por um <strong>PIX de R$250.<\\/strong> Ele ir\\u00e1 criar uma nova venda, agora de <strong>$50,00<\\/strong>, que ir\\u00e1 gerar uma taxa de <strong>$1.50<\\/strong>.<br \\/>Ao consultar a p\\u00e1gina de taxas, ele ver\\u00e1 duas taxas diferentes, que totalizam <strong>$2.70<\\/strong>.<br \\/>Agora sim, ele ter\\u00e1 que fazer o pagamento, atrav\\u00e9s do bot\\u00e3o \\\"<strong>Pay with PayPal\\\" <\\/strong>que ir\\u00e1 estar vis\\u00edvel ao lado do valor das taxas, em <strong>Pay Fees.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"c535194\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/WhatsApp-Image-2023-02-22-at-14.51.44.jpeg\",\"id\":360,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"e0c8065\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Quando o bot\\u00e3o <strong>Pay with PayPal<\\/strong> estiver vis\\u00edvel, clique nele e siga as instru\\u00e7\\u00f5es do PayPal para o pagamento.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c26f989\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"02b0a24\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2672f5a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
