m\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"insert_url\":\"yes\",\"external_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/videos\\/math-trade-bh\\/2-como-adicionar-jogos.mp4\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":320,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"custom\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"custom\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"acf7b29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"bdf30e9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Video retirado do\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCY4AO_6AUGiWmP3GocAdcFA\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">canal\\u00a0<\\/a>Mesa Secreta. Para ficar por dentro de todo material produzido, n\\u00e3o deixe de seguir o canal.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"edb7c6f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Durante a primeira etapa voc\\u00ea preenche a lista com os seus jogos que deseja trocar. Lembrando que, colocar os jogos na lista ainda n\\u00e3o significa que voc\\u00ea tem obriga\\u00e7\\u00e3o de troc\\u00e1-los. \\u00c9 apenas um cadastro do que voc\\u00ea pretende ofertar.<\\/p><p>A inclus\\u00e3o pode ser feita diretamente na\\u00a0<b>GeekList<\\/b>\\u00a0na op\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\u00a0<em><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Add Item<\\/span><\\/em>\\u00a0e \\u00e9 super importante\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>descrever completamente as caracter\\u00edsticas e condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es do jogo<\\/strong>.<\\/span>\\u00a0Al\\u00e9m disso informe tamb\\u00e9m:\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\/Vers\\u00e3o, Idioma, Estado do jogo (lacrado, novo, usado) e outras informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es relevantes.<\\/span><br \\/><em><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Exemplo: Se est\\u00e1 sleevado, se possui insert, se tem algum dano na caixa, quinas esbranqui\\u00e7adas, mofo (tratado ou n\\u00e3o), cartas amassadas, dados danificados, minis pintadas, componentes 3D, etc.<\\/span><\\/em><\\/p><p>Como explicado no v\\u00eddeo, voc\\u00ea tamb\\u00e9m tem a op\\u00e7\\u00e3o de agrupar jogos em um \\u00fanico item, tentando aumentar o seu valor de troca. Caso tenha d\\u00favidas, procure os organizadores da MT.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Open Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c6652e3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6092a0b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"49ee1ee\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8b1c406\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fc32e6\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d53ecd8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SEGUNDA ETAPA: DEFINI\\u00c7\\u00c3O E ENVIO DA SUA LISTA DE DESEJOS\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"af5fabd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settin