<br \\/>uma Math Trade<\\/h4>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"align\\\":\\\"center\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center\\\">Se n\\u00e3o sabe o que \\u00e9 uma Math Trade, n\\u00f3s ajudamos. Temos uma p\\u00e1gina com explica\\u00e7\\u00f5es b\\u00e1sicas do que \\u00e9 e como funciona uma Math Trade.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"blockGap\\\":\\\"8px\\\"}}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column\\\"><!-- wp:image {\\\"id\\\":41,\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"linkDestination\\\":\\\"none\\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full\\\"><img class=\\\"wp-image-41\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/regras-gerais-math-trade.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n<!-- \\/wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"level\\\":4,\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"margin\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"16px\\\"}}}} -->\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\\\" style=\\\"margin-top: 16px;\\\">Conhe\\u00e7a um pouco <br \\/>mais das regras<\\/h4>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"align\\\":\\\"center\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center\\\">Agora que j\\u00e1 sabe o que \\u00e9, pode dar uma olhada na nossa p\\u00e1gina de regras gerais para se ambientar e estar pronto a participar de uma Math Trade.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><!-- wp:column {\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"blockGap\\\":\\\"8px\\\"}}} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-column\\\"><!-- wp:image {\\\"id\\\":42,\\\"sizeSlug\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"linkDestination\\\":\\\"none\\\"} -->\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-image size-full\\\"><img class=\\\"wp-image-42\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/615x330-MT-Fev23.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n<!-- \\/wp:image --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"textAlign\\\":\\\"center\\\",\\\"level\\\":4,\\\"style\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":{\\\"margin\\\":{\\\"top\\\":\\\"16px\\\"}}}} -->\\n<h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\\\" style=\\\"margin-top: 16px;\\\">Math Trade BH <br \\/>5a edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o<\\/h4>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"align\\\":\\\"center\\\"} -->\\n<p class=\\\"has-text-align-center\\\">No come\\u00e7o de Fevereiro de 2023 realizamos a 5a edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da Math Trade BH. Como sempre, um sucesso de cadastros e trocas.<\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:column --><\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:columns --><!-- wp:spacer {\\\"height\\\":\\\"40px\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-spacer\\\" style=\\\"height: 40px;\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\u00a0<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:spacer --><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} -->\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">NOSSOS TORNEIOS<\\/h3>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:media-text {\\\"align\\\":\\\"wide\\\",\\\"mediaId\\\":55,\\\"mediaLink\\\":\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/?attachment_id=55\\\",\\\"mediaType\\\":\\\"image\\\"} -->\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-media-text alignwide is-stacked-on-mobile\\\">\\n<figure class=\\\"wp-block-media-text__media\\\"><img class=\\\"wp-image-55 size-full\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-1024x347.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-media-text__content\\\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"Conte\\u00fado...\\\"} -->\\n<p><strong>ENCERRADO<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>Em 2022 realizamos etapas regionais de Carcassonne, classificat\\u00f3rias para o nacional. Em 2023 teremos mais novidades<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<!-- \\/wp:group -->\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d0aedb1\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"backgro