(3902, 656, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"5fb07c2\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b24cbf5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dadc2a7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"AS 4 ETAPAS DE UMA MATH TRDE\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"09aafe4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"29bc0ec\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"599762d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"aa23918\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/bgbh_white.png\",\"id\":205,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_attachment\":\"fixed\",\"background_repeat\":\"repeat\",\"background_size\":\"initial\",\"background_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":5,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_overlay_color\":\"\",\"background_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=primary\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\",\"background_overlay_color\":\"#0C5B36\",\"css_filters_css_filter\":\"custom\",\"css_filters_blur\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5ce0a15\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"68873c7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"PRIMEIRA ETAPA: INCLUS\\u00c3O DE JOGOS NA LISTA DE TROCAS\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"1e182da\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"30\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"aac06fd\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"b994f27\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"367acdb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"insert_url\":\"yes\",\"external_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/videos\\/math-trade-bh\\/2-como-adicionar-jogos.mp4\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":320,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"custom\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_custom_width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"custom\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"acf7b29\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"bdf30e9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Video retirado do\\u00a0<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/channel\\/UCY4AO_6AUGiWmP3GocAdcFA\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">canal\\u00a0<\\/a>Mesa Secreta. Para ficar por dentro de todo material produzido, n\\u00e3o deixe de seguir o canal.<\\/p>\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"edb7c6f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Durante a primeira etapa voc\\u00ea preenche a lista com os seus jogos que deseja trocar. Lembrando que, colocar os jogos na lista ainda n\\u00e3o significa que voc\\u00ea tem obriga\\u00e7\\u00e3o de troc\\u00e1-los. \\u00c9 apenas um cadastro do que voc\\u00ea pretende ofertar.<\\/p><p>A inclus\\u00e3o pode ser feita diretamente na\\u00a0<b>GeekList<\\/b>\\u00a0na op\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\u00a0<em><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Add Item<\\/span><\\/em>\\u00a0e \\u00e9 super importante\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>descrever completamente as caracter\\u00edsticas e condi\\u00e7\\u00f5es do jogo<\\/strong>.<\\/span>\\u00a0Al\\u00e9m disso informe tamb\\u00e9m:\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">Edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o\\/Vers\\u00e3o, Idioma, Estado do jogo (lacrado, novo, usado) e outras informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es relevantes.<\\/span><br \\/><em><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Exemplo: Se est\\u00e1 sleevado, se possui insert, se tem algum dano na caixa, quinas esbranqui\\u00e7adas, mofo (tratado ou n\\u00e3o), cartas amassadas, dados danificados, minis pintadas, componentes 3D, etc.<\\/span><\\/em><\\/p><p>Como explicado no v\\u00eddeo, voc\\u00ea tamb\\u00e9m tem a op\\u00e7\\u00e3o de agrupar jogos em um \\u00fanico item, tentando aumentar o seu valor de troca. Caso tenha d\\u00favidas, procure os organizadores da MT.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Open Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c6652e3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6092a0b\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"49ee1ee\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"8b1c406\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9fc32e6\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d53ecd8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"SEGUNDA ETAPA: DEFINI\\u00c7\\u00c3O E ENVIO DA SUA LISTA DE DESEJOS\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"af5fabd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\u00c9 o momento de selecionar os jogos que deseja e marcar por qual da sua lista voc\\u00ea aceita trocar. Os jogos selecionados nessa etapa s\\u00e3o os jogos que pretende receber.\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>N\\u00e3o necessariamente todos os seus jogos ser\\u00e3o trocados. <\\/strong>As trocas <\\/span>depender\\u00e3o da escolha dos outros participantes e do algoritmo da Math Trade.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Open Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"fdd61df\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<em>Exemplo:<\\/em>\\n<ul>\\n \\t<li><em>Voc\\u00ea selecionar\\u00e1 o jogo X, Y, W e Z que deseja receber. Depois ir\\u00e1 indicar quais desses deseja receber em troca dos que cadastrou na PRIMEIRA ETAPA.<\\/em><\\/li>\\n \\t<li><em>Para o seu jogo A voc\\u00ea marcar\\u00e1 que aceita receber os jogos X e Y<\\/em><\\/li>\\n \\t<li><em>Para o seu jogo B nenhum foi compat\\u00edvel para voc\\u00ea, logo voc\\u00ea n\\u00e3o marca nenhuma op\\u00e7\\u00e3o e ele n\\u00e3o ser\\u00e1 trocado<\\/em><\\/li>\\n \\t<li><em>Para o seu jogo C voc\\u00ea marcar\\u00e1 que aceita receber os jogos Y, W e Z<\\/em><\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Open Sans\",\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"c105041\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"bold\\\"><strong>Essa etapa tem 3 fases e todas essas fases s\\u00e3o feitas no OLWLG.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a9fb218\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8a7c2bc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0002f67\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"FASE 2.1 - Sele\\u00e7\\u00e3o dos jogos que deseja receber\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor2\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"ae91833\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Nessa etapa voc\\u00ea escolhe os jogos que pretende receber. Para isso, \\u00e9 preciso ir na lista dos jogos sincronizados, identificados pela imagem\\u00a0<img class=\\\"alignnone\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/step3.jpeg\\\" alt=\\\"step 3\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"28\\\" \\/>\\u00a0E clicar na imagem\\u00a0<img class=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/1click.png\\\" alt=\\\"add item\\\" width=\\\"33\\\" height=\\\"33\\\" \\/>\\u00a0para cada jogo que deseja incluir na lista dos jogos que pretende receber. (Pode tamb\\u00e9m clicar no bot\\u00e3o \\\"Add\\\")<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3067457\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2a2fe62\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"56c6638\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"FASE 2.2 - Marcar os jogos que deseja trocar pelos seus\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor2\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"93b82c7\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Nessa etapa voc\\u00ea escolhe os jogos que pretende trocar pelos seus.\\u00a0<img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/exemplo-tabela.png\\\" alt=\\\"tabela de trocas\\\" \\/><\\/p><p>A tabela apresenta um exemplo de como funciona a marca\\u00e7\\u00e3o do que deseja trocar.<\\/p><p>As\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">colunas<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0correspondem aos seus jogos que <strong>voc\\u00ea adicionou<\\/strong> na\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">sua lista de trocas<\\/span>\\u00a0<strong>durante a primeira etapa<\\/strong>.<br \\/>As\\u00a0<strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">linhas<\\/span><\\/strong> correspondem aos jogos que voc\\u00ea adicionou <strong>na lista de desejos<\\/strong> na fase 2.1 e que <span class=\\\"bold\\\">pretende receber<\\/span><br \\/>Marcar o quadradinho indica que <strong>aceita enviar o seu jogo da coluna correspondente para receber o jogo da linha correspondente<\\/strong>. Em outras palavras, que voc\\u00ea <strong>aceita uma\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">poss\\u00edvel troca<\\/span> do seu jogo (da coluna) pelo jogo marcado na linha<\\/strong>.<br \\/><em><span class=\\\"fst-italic\\\">Nesse exemplo significa que aceito enviar o Pulsar 2849 para receber o Chaos in the Old World.<\\/span><\\/em><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"49a0bfd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"alert_type\":\"danger\",\"alert_title\":\"Aten\\u00e7\\u00e3o\",\"alert_description\":\"Tenha muita aten\\u00e7\\u00e3o nessa fase para n\\u00e3o marcar jogos por engano!\\nEsta \\u00e9 a sele\\u00e7\\u00e3o usada pelo algoritmo de trocas para gerar o resultado final.\",\"show_dismiss\":\"hide\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"alert\"},{\"id\":\"b2e71cb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><strong>Veja no v\\u00eddeo abaixo como fazer a marca\\u00e7\\u00e3o dos jogos que voc\\u00ea tem interesse. <\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"322376e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"30\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2fdf5dc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"fafbfbc\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0993c5b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"insert_url\":\"yes\",\"external_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/videos\\/math-trade-bh\\/3-escolhendo-jogos-que-tenho-interesse.mp4\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":320,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"eb26183\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"529bb36\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8ec8353\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bf141ec\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"FASE 2.3 - Confirmar suas escolhas e submeter a lista de desejos\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h5\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=astglobalcolor2\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6b510ab\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Ap\\u00f3s marcar todos os quadradinhos referente as suas escolhas, \\u00e9 necess\\u00e1rio confirmar essa escolha submetendo a mesma. Para isso \\u00e9 preciso clicar no bot\\u00e3o verde\\u00a0<span class=\\\"green-highlight\\\">How to Submit Your Lists<\\/span>\\u00a0e depois clicar no bot\\u00e3o \\\"Submit My Wants\\\".<br \\/><br \\/><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/how-to-submit.png\\\" alt=\\\"submiter lista de trocas\\\" \\/><br \\/><br \\/>Ap\\u00f3s clicar no\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">\\\"Submit My Wants\\\"<\\/span>\\u00a0\\u00e9 apresentada uma tela de confirma\\u00e7\\u00e3o de envio da sua lista.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d771106\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"35efc84\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"abb9a69\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6b700a6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFE7B4\",\"stretch_section\":\"section-stretched\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b22dd39\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ee50a9f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"55c850a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"alert_type\":\"warning\",\"alert_title\":\"ATEN\\u00c7\\u00c3O! Como evitar itens duplicados?\\u200b\",\"alert_description\":\"Fique atento! Se voc\\u00ea selecionar um mesmo jogo de pessoas diferentes, voc\\u00ea pode ser surpreendido no resultado, e acabar recebendo duas c\\u00f3pias do mesmo jogo. Para que isso n\\u00e3o aconte\\u00e7a assista o v\\u00eddeo tutorial abaixo explicando como evitar esse problema.\",\"show_dismiss\":\"hide\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"alert\"},{\"id\":\"44814c1\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"structure\":\"30\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3d1c870\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"d4b3dba\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"be929fb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"video_type\":\"hosted\",\"youtube_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E\",\"vimeo_url\":\"https:\\/\\/vimeo.com\\/235215203\",\"dailymotion_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.dailymotion.com\\/video\\/x6tqhqb\",\"insert_url\":\"yes\",\"external_url\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/videos\\/math-trade-bh\\/6-evitando-jogos-duplicados.mp4\",\"is_external\":\"\",\"nofollow\":\"\",\"custom_attributes\":\"\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":320,\"sizes\":[]},\"_element_vertical_align\":\"center\",\"videopress_url\":\"https:\\/\\/videopress.com\\/v\\/ZCAOzTNk\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"video\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"9e70694\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":33,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"2da62a5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"ac7d01d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><span class=\\\"bold\\\" style=\\\"font-weight: bold;\\\">ATEN\\u00c7\\u00c3O! <\\/span><strong><span class=\\\"bold\\\">Linhas vermelhas no final do processo indicam que algo est\\u00e1 errado na sua prote\\u00e7\\u00e3o de duplicados. Fique atento para as marca\\u00e7\\u00f5es dos quadradinhos nesses casos. Caso tenha algum problema ou d\\u00favida, entre em contato com os participantes do grupo ou com os organizadores.<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ddfc2bb\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"028fbe2\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1b7bda8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"d8c679b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"TERCEIRA ETAPA: RESULTADO\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a9fb3da\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"col-12 terceira-etapa\\\"><p>Durante a terceira etapa a organiza\\u00e7\\u00e3o executa o algoritmo e o sistema calcula as trocas e define o resultado. <br \\/><strong>Ap\\u00f3s esse resultado \\u00e9 obrigat\\u00f3rio o envio dos jogos.<\\/strong><\\/p><p class=\\\"fst-italic\\\"><em>Essa \\u00e9 uma etapa feita somente pelos administradores da Math Trade e o link com o resultado \\u00e9 enviado para todos do grupo, ficando tamb\\u00e9m dispon\\u00edvel diretamente no OLWLG.<\\/em><\\/p><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b09b9a9\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a60b862\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2199502\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"QUARTA ETAPA: ENTREGA DOS JOGOS\\n\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"__globals__\":{\"title_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"e056437\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Ap\\u00f3s a divulga\\u00e7\\u00e3o do resultado oficial \\u00e9 chegado o momento da entrega dos jogos. <br \\/><strong>Cada Math Trade possui regras espec\\u00edficas para essa etapa.<\\/strong> Algumas definem um dia e local para que todos fa\\u00e7am as trocas presencialmente, outras definem um prazo para o envio utilizando algum servi\\u00e7o de entrega, como transportadoras e correios. <br \\/>Por esse motivo, <strong>fique atento \\u00e0s especifica\\u00e7\\u00f5es de entrega que cada MATH TRADE possui.<\\/strong><\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
