(6623, 975, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"368e7f0\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"deb6721\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3646c5a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/01\\/imagem-topo.png\",\"id\":77,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d767f7b\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"506e88d\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e15371\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6bccaf6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"95ce578\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1d2db68\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"MATH TRADE BGBH - 9\\u00aa Edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o - Novembro 2024\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"3f8cfdd\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8955a95\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7629819\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>\\u00c9 hora de trocar aqueles jogos parados na estante na 8\\u00aa edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o da nossa MathTrade!<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6fb2a26\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"background_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3ba0815\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"#C00000\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"4\",\"right\":\"4\",\"bottom\":\"4\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bbd5f06\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"col-12\\\"><p class=\\\"bold border border-danger p-2 mb-4\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-danger\\\">IMPORTANTE!<\\/span> <\\/strong><\\/span>Antes de ir adiante, precisamos saber se \\u00e9 a sua primeira Math Trade. Caso seja, n\\u00e3o deixe de conferir primeiro as p\\u00e1ginas que explicam\\u00a0<a class=\\\"badge bg-danger text-decoration-none button-link-on-text\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/mathtrade-bh\\/o-que-e.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">O QUE \\u00c9 UMA MATH TRADE<\\/a>\\u00a0e tamb\\u00e9m a p\\u00e1gina de\\u00a0<a class=\\\"badge bg-danger text-decoration-none button-link-on-text\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/mathtrade-bh\\/regras-gerais.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">REGRAS GERAIS DE UMA MATH TRADE<\\/a><\\/p><\\/div>\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b31672e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c37f99\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c07f58\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f268a03\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b6b21ad\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0af58a0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"REGRAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS DA MATH TRADE BGBH (9\\u00aa Ed.)\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c4e034c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7490e23\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d3c320f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul style=\\\"margin-bottom:0; padding-bottom:0\\\">\\n \\t<li>\\u00c9\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">imprescind\\u00edvel<\\/span>\\u00a0que os participantes da Math Trade BGBH possam\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">entregar e retirar seus jogos em Belo Horizonte\\u00a0<\\/span>. N\\u00e3o \\u00e9 vetada a participa\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pessoas de fora da cidade desde que elas consigam atender as regras de entrega dentro do prazo estabelecido.<\\/li>\\n \\t<li>Ao adicionar uma\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">EXPANS\\u00c3O<\\/span>, antes de descrev\\u00ea-la, indique j\\u00e1 na\\u00a0<b>PRIMEIRA FRASE<\\/b>\\u00a0do item essa informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o com a frase\\u00a0<span class=\\\"yellow-highlight bold danger\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000; background-color: #ff0;\\\">ESTE ITEM \\u00c9 UMA EXPANS\\u00c3O, SENDO NECESS\\u00c1RIO O JOGO BASE PARA UTILIZ\\u00c1-LO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0<\\/span>, grifando-o de amarelo e o texto de cor vermelha, como no exemplo abaixo:\\n<img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/exemplo-expansao.png\\\" alt=\\\"exemplo expansao grifada\\\" \\/>\\n<em>Expans\\u00f5es sem essa informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o poder\\u00e3o ser removidas sem aviso pr\\u00e9vio pelos moderadores antes da libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o da segunda etapa no momento da revis\\u00e3o, no entanto caso algum item passe despercebido nessa revis\\u00e3o, os moderadores n\\u00e3o ser\\u00e3o responsabilizados por eventuais trocas realizadas por esses itens.<\\/em><\\/li>\\n \\t<li>Os itens dos participantes que <strong>N\\u00c3O possu\\u00edrem cadastro para a Math Trade<\\/strong> ser\\u00e3o removidos da geeklist.<\\/li>\\n \\t<li>Participantes que\\u00a0<b>N\\u00c3O estiverem no grupo de informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es SEM CHAT<\\/b>\\u00a0da MathTrade ser\\u00e3o removidos da geeklist. (O Grupo\\u00a0<b>COM<\\/b>\\u00a0Chat, embora muito \\u00fatil para algumas pessoas durante o processo, \\u00e9 opcional)<\\/li>\\n \\t<li>Fique atento ao cronograma de entrega dos jogos que estabelece que nesta edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o os jogos\\u00a0<b>devem ser entregues at\\u00e9 as 17h de s\\u00e1bado, dia 27 de Junho<\\/b>\\u00a0e que sofre pequenas altera\\u00e7\\u00f5es em cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\",\"column_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f52c56e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divisor\",\"color\":\"#E6E6E6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9b54046\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd010c8\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b9a8161\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h3 class=\\\"bold mt-3\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">O QUE SER\\u00c1 PERMITIDO NESTA EDI\\u00c7\\u00c3O<\\/span><\\/h3><ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>At\\u00e9\\u00a0<b>TR\\u00caS<\\/b>\\u00a0ofertas em\\u00a0<b>DINHEIRO<\\/b>\\u00a0ser\\u00e3o permitidas como itens de troca nesta edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o. Esses itens dever\\u00e3o ser cadastrados individualmente como\\u00a0<b>OUTSIDE SCOPE OF BGG<\\/b>\\u00a0(c\\u00f3digo 23953) e o pagamento dever\\u00e1 ser realizado por PIX.\\u00a0<b>N\\u00e3o ser\\u00e1 permitida a cria\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pacotes contendo dinheiro + jogos.<\\/b><br \\/><em>obs: O BGG exige o pagamento de taxas para o site em caso de trocas em dinheiro. Consulte o site ou nos grupos de whatsapp como essa taxa deve ser paga.<\\/em><br \\/>Aten\\u00e7\\u00e3o: \\u00c9\\u00a0<b class=\\\"danger\\\">PROIBIDO<\\/b>\\u00a0fazer a sele\\u00e7\\u00e3o de\\u00a0<b>DINHEIRO por DINHEIRO<\\/b>. Caso uma troca dessa natureza seja identificada,\\u00a0<span class=\\\"danger\\\">o respons\\u00e1vel ser\\u00e1 exclu\\u00eddo da pr\\u00f3xima MathTrade<\\/span>\\u00a0e receber\\u00e1 o mesmo valor que ofertou, impossibilitando qualquer tipo de lucro com essa pr\\u00e1tica.<\\/li><li><b>Livros de RPG e acess\\u00f3rios relacionados a boardgame<\\/b>\\u00a0poder\\u00e3o ser adicionados apenas nas\\u00a0<b>\\u00faltimas 12 horas<\\/b>\\u00a0da primeira etapa e devem ser cadastrados atrav\\u00e9s do c\\u00f3digo 23953 (\\\"Outside the scope of BGG\\\"). Itens cadastrados descumprindo essa regra ser\\u00e3o removidos da geeklist sem aviso pr\\u00e9vio.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9a087c5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3650894\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"421b6e8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"text\":\"Divisor\",\"color\":\"#E6E6E6\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"51ef898\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6854722\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4d58aee\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h3 class=\\\"bold mt-3\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff6600;\\\">O QUE N\\u00c3O SER\\u00c1 PERMITIDO NESTA EDI\\u00c7\\u00c3O<\\/span><\\/h3><ul class=\\\"mt-3\\\"><li>N\\u00e3o ser\\u00e1 permitido o cadastro de\\u00a0<b>cartas promocionais<\\/b>\\u00a0como itens isolados. Os mesmos ainda poder\\u00e3o ser ofertados dentro de pacotes de jogos.<\\/li><li>N\\u00e3o ser\\u00e1 permitido o cadastro de cartas avulsas ou decks dos seguintes cardgames nesta edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o:<br \\/><b>Magic: The Gathering, Keyforge, Star Wars Destiny, Pokemon, Yu-Gi-Oh!, Battle Scenes, VTES e Flash and Blood<\\/b><br \\/>Os demais cardgames seguem permitidos na geeklist.<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4d7efd4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e24ac21\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bf1674a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"616f524\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/blog\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/02\\/bgbh_green.png\",\"id\":204,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"e690e46\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ffb476a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"PRIMEIRA ETAPA\",\"percent\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]},\"display_percentage\":\"\",\"inner_text\":\"Adicionando seus jogos na lista de trocas\",\"bar_color\":\"#057E24\",\"bar_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"bar_inner_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"bar_inner_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"ty