er\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"6fb2a26\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"background_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3ba0815\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"border_border\":\"solid\",\"border_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"1\",\"right\":\"1\",\"bottom\":\"1\",\"left\":\"1\",\"isLinked\":true},\"border_color\":\"#C00000\",\"border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"4\",\"right\":\"4\",\"bottom\":\"4\",\"left\":\"4\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bbd5f06\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<div class=\\\"col-12\\\"><p class=\\\"bold border border-danger p-2 mb-4\\\"><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000;\\\"><strong><span class=\\\"text-danger\\\">IMPORTANTE!<\\/span> <\\/strong><\\/span>Antes de ir adiante, precisamos saber se \\u00e9 a sua primeira Math Trade. Caso seja, n\\u00e3o deixe de conferir primeiro as p\\u00e1ginas que explicam\\u00a0<a class=\\\"badge bg-danger text-decoration-none button-link-on-text\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/mathtrade-bh\\/o-que-e.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">O QUE \\u00c9 UMA MATH TRADE<\\/a>\\u00a0e tamb\\u00e9m a p\\u00e1gina de\\u00a0<a class=\\\"badge bg-danger text-decoration-none button-link-on-text\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/mathtrade-bh\\/regras-gerais.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">REGRAS GERAIS DE UMA MATH TRADE<\\/a><\\/p><\\/div>\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b31672e\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c37f99\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2c07f58\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f268a03\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b6b21ad\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0af58a0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"REGRAS ESPEC\\u00cdFICAS DA MATH TRADE BGBH (9\\u00aa Ed.)\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"c4e034c\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7490e23\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d3c320f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li>\\u00c9\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">imprescind\\u00edvel<\\/span>\\u00a0que os participantes da Math Trade BGBH possam\\u00a0<span style=\\\"font-weight: bolder;\\\">entregar e retirar seus jogos em Belo Horizonte\\u00a0<\\/span>. N\\u00e3o \\u00e9 vetada a participa\\u00e7\\u00e3o de pessoas de fora da cidade desde que elas consigam atender as regras de entrega dentro do prazo estabelecido.<\\/li><li>Ao adicionar uma\\u00a0<span class=\\\"bold\\\">EXPANS\\u00c3O<\\/span>, antes de descrev\\u00ea-la, indique j\\u00e1 na\\u00a0<b>PRIMEIRA FRASE<\\/b>\\u00a0do item essa informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o com a frase\\u00a0<span class=\\\"yellow-highlight bold danger\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"color: #ff0000; background-color: #ff0;\\\">ESTE ITEM \\u00c9 UMA EXPANS\\u00c3O, SENDO NECESS\\u00c1RIO O JOGO BASE PARA UTILIZ\\u00c1-LO<\\/span><\\/strong>\\u00a0<\\/span>, grifando-o de amarelo e o texto de cor vermelha, como no exemplo abaixo:<br \\/><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/bgbh.com.br\\/public\\/images\\/math-trade\\/exemplo-expansao.png\\\" alt=\\\"exemplo expansao grifada\\\" \\/><br \\/><em>Expans\\u00f5es sem essa informa\\u00e7\\u00e3o poder\\u00e3o ser removidas sem aviso pr\\u00e9vio pelos moderadores antes da libera\\u00e7\\u00e3o da segunda etapa no momento da revis\\u00e3o, no entanto caso algum item passe despercebido nessa revis\\u00e3o, os moderadores n\\u00e3o ser\\u00e3o responsabilizados por eventuais trocas realizadas por esses itens.<\\/em><\\/li><li>Os itens dos participantes que <strong>N\\u00c3O possu\\u00edrem cadastro para a Math Trade<\\/strong> ser\\u00e3o removidos da geeklist.<\\/li><li>Participantes que\\u00a0<b>N\\u00c3O estiverem no grupo de informa\\u00e7\\u00f5es SEM CHAT<\\/b>\\u00a0da MathTrade ser\\u00e3o removidos da geeklist. (O Grupo\\u00a0<b>COM<\\/b>\\u00a0Chat, embora muito \\u00fatil para algumas pessoas durante o processo, \\u00e9 opcional)<\\/li><li>Fique atento ao cronograma de entrega dos jogos que estabelece que nesta edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o os jogos\\u00a0<b>devem ser entregues at\\u00e9 as 17h de s\\u00e1bado, dia 27 de Junho<\\/b>\\u00a0e que sofre pequenas altera\\u00e7\\u00f5es em cada edi\\u00e7\\u00e3o.<\\/li><li>\\u00a0<\\/li><\\/ul>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"9a087c5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3650894\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
