<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\">Lorem ipsum dolor consectetur adipiscing elit eiusmod.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"top\":\"60px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"inherit\":true,\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" id=\"services\" style=\"padding-top:60px;padding-bottom:0px\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2>Math Trade Belo Horizonte - Fevereiro 2023</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Para começar bem o ano, vamos de Math Trade BH!</strong><br>Clique nas imagens abaixo para conhecer o que é, para ver as regras gerais ou para saber os detalhes específicos dessa edição.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"50px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\" style=\"margin-top:50px\"><!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"8px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":40,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/o-que-e-uma-math-trade.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-40\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<h3 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Branding Design</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sem quis erat nibh id neque tincidunt molestie convallis ut nibh vel, lorem consequat ullamcorper.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"8px\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":41,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"htt