n-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/322515922_5441748755952564_4142625563983561065_n-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/322515922_5441748755952564_4142625563983561065_n.jpeg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" />													\n													<img width=\"720\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n-1024x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n-1024x1024.jpeg 1024w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n-300x300.jpeg 300w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n-768x768.jpeg 768w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/326133700_189372070344481_5452170378878663579_n.jpeg 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" />													\n			<h2>JOGATINAS</h2>		\n			<h2>JOGA NO QG</h2>		\n													<img src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		<p>Nosso evento de jogatina mensal no nosso QG.<br />A cada temporada, novas datas e novidades aguardam nossos jogadores.<br />Ótima oportunidades para conhecer novos jogos e fazer amizades dentro do hobby.</p>		\n			<h2>RESENHA COM JOGATINA</h2>		\n													<img src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />													\n		<p>Aquele evento esporádico misturado com jogatina que todos gostam. Seja churrasco, seja aquecimento para alguma Con, seja um dia no sítio, enfim, tudo é desculpa para juntar amigos, divertir e jogar. Fique ligado na nossa agenda para saber o próximo.</p>		\n			<h2>TORNEIOS REALIZADOS</h2>		\n													<img width=\"720\" height=\"244\" src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-1024x347.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-1024x347.png 1024w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-300x102.png 300w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-768x260.png 768w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web-1536x520.png 1536w, https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Carcassonne-Banner-Web.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\" />													\n		<h3><b>CLASSIFICATÓRIAS CARCASSONNE</b></h3>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Em 2023 realizamos etapas regionais de Carcassonne, classificatórias para o nacional. Em 2024 teremos mais novidades</p>		\n			<style>/*! elementor - v3.22.0 - 17-06-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container{position:static}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-container .swiper-slide figure,.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper .swiper-slide figure{line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-image-carousel .swiper-slide{text-align:center}.elementor-image-carousel-wrapper:not(.swiper-container-initialized):not(.swiper-initialized) .swiper-slide{max-width:calc(100% / var(--e-image-carousel-slides-to-show, 3))}</style>		\n								<figure><img data-src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/torneio-carcassonne-300x161.png\" alt=\"torneio-carcassonne\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/torneio-draftosaurus-300x161.png\" alt=\"torneio-draftosaurus\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://bgbh.com.br/blog/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/torneio-7wduel-300x161.png\" alt=\"torneio-7wduel\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://bgbh.com.